{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\drawing\\077.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Purpose of Exhibicion", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[133, 47], [688, 41], [689, 93], [134, 99]]}, {"text": "Public gets a dhamce to enjoy art works.", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[332, 325], [1094, 279], [1096, 324], [335, 370]]}, {"text": "Thepublicis educatedaboutart.", "conf": 0.831, "box": [[336, 390], [967, 354], [969, 396], [338, 432]]}, {"text": "The arist and his work are introduced to the public.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[331, 446], [1355, 397], [1357, 447], [333, 496]]}, {"text": "Public can buy art works.", "conf": 0.815, "box": [[328, 517], [808, 491], [811, 534], [330, 560]]}, {"text": "Exhibition links thepublicandthearuist", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[326, 647], [1109, 614], [1111, 657], [328, 690]]}, {"text": "How to Display", "conf": 0.837, "box": [[126, 778], [457, 780], [457, 823], [126, 821]]}, {"text": "Remember the following points about displaying your artwork.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[124, 843], [1359, 810], [1361, 862], [125, 895]]}, {"text": "Display in a place with sufficient and proper amount of light.", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[250, 975], [1458, 950], [1459, 999], [251, 1024]]}, {"text": "It is very important to display the work at eye level. The viewer", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[245, 1041], [1519, 1017], [1520, 1069], [246, 1094]]}, {"text": "must be comfortable to watch theart work. In case the work is", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[244, 1110], [1505, 1089], [1506, 1138], [245, 1159]]}, {"text": "above eye level, the viewer willhave to hold his neck up which is", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[245, 1177], [1542, 1161], [1543, 1208], [246, 1224]]}, {"text": "very uncomfortable.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[242, 1251], [638, 1242], [639, 1282], [243, 1291]]}, {"text": "Bwaz", "conf": 0.656, "box": [[610, 1297], [734, 1223], [758, 1264], [635, 1338]]}, {"text": "The works should not be too close to each other. Let there be", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[241, 1311], [1492, 1305], [1493, 1350], [242, 1356]]}, {"text": "artwork gets due time and attention.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[235, 1452], [961, 1449], [961, 1492], [236, 1495]]}, {"text": "Viewers should be asked not to touch theartwork.", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[236, 1520], [1254, 1524], [1254, 1567], [235, 1563]]}, {"text": "A tag with the title of the artwork and price (if it is for sale) should", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[226, 1587], [1592, 1592], [1592, 1648], [225, 1643]]}, {"text": "be stuck nearby.", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[225, 1660], [553, 1666], [552, 1712], [224, 1706]]}, {"text": "If it is a group exhibition, the artworks must be displayed in separate", "conf": 0.948, "box": [[217, 1724], [1618, 1737], [1617, 1803], [216, 1791]]}, {"text": "groups with artists' name.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[222, 1805], [735, 1811], [734, 1857], [221, 1851]]}, {"text": "Activity:5.3", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[106, 1981], [363, 1985], [362, 2029], [105, 2025]]}, {"text": "Visitto an art exhibition.", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[388, 1984], [808, 1998], [807, 2034], [387, 2020]]}, {"text": "NotforSale,FreefromGovernment", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[763, 2108], [1449, 2137], [1447, 2183], [761, 2154]]}, {"text": "74", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[1481, 2115], [1555, 2108], [1560, 2165], [1486, 2172]]}, {"text": "ScannedwithCamScanner", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[1093, 2324], [1275, 2325], [1275, 2345], [1093, 2344]]}]}